# Pre-state overworld entrance gates (tools/maps/world.py LOC_COND_PRE). Each explains the closed door in-world.

@scene GATE_T02
if ch:CH02 wanted
say narr | Veyr's south gate. A queue of carts, a clerk with a ledger. The quarry lies behind you, and your report isn't written yet.
say oriel | Brackenford first. The workers, then the capital.
end
label wanted
call VEYR_WANTED
@end

@scene GATE_D03
say narr | The Rootward forest, north of the capital. Ministry foresters wave travellers away: 'Sluice works. Closed.'
@end

@scene GATE_T03
say narr | The northern road into Cinder Reach. A ministry barricade blocks the pass, and the foresters say the only way around it runs through the Rootward.
@end

@scene GATE_T04
say narr | The coast road to Bellharbor. A checkpoint turns back anyone without a harbour pass - and the party is wanted.
@end

@scene GATE_D05
say narr | The Drowned Archive sits on its tide island. Without someone who knows the tide tables, the causeway is a good way to drown.
@end

@scene GATE_D06
say narr | The foot of the Skychain Viaduct. The span is closed: 'Anchors failed. No crossings.' The ferry north is the only way to the cable foot.
@end

@scene GATE_T05
say narr | High Aerie is on the far side of the chasm. With the Skychain closed, there's no way across.
@end

@scene GATE_D07
say narr | Whitebone Redoubt's outer patrols turn you back long before the white gate. Not yet.
@end

@scene GATE_T06
say narr | The salt road to Nacre runs through redoubt patrols from Whitebone. Without a way across the chasm, it's a long walk into their arms.
@end

@scene GATE_D08
say narr | The vault road. Redoubt soldiers still hold the approach.
@end

@scene GATE_D09
say narr | The old aqueduct entrance under Veyr. Barred, and humming faintly. Not yet.
@end
